OL,3,GNEWSALocals want to buy old theatre
OL,4,Aafter auction fail
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocals who have campaigned to try to
OL,7,Fsave a historical theatre from
OL,8,Fdemolition say they want to buy it
OL,9,Fafter it failed to sell at auction.
OL,11,FHulme Hippodrome in Manchester was
OL,12,Flisted for a reserve price of #895,000,
OL,13,Fbut on Thursday bidding failed to reach
OL,14,Fthat mark.
OL,16,FThe Grade II-listed building was last
OL,17,Fused for theatre in the 1960s, and has
OL,18,Fsince hosted live recordings of BBC
OL,19,Fshows, bingo events, and a church
OL,20,Fcongregation. It has been left empty
OL,21,Fsince 2017.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
