OL,3,GNEWSALocals want to buy old theatre
OL,4,Aafter auction fail
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Baker, from the Save Hulme
OL,7,FHippodrome campaign group, said they
OL,8,Fhad been "chasing this building for
OL,9,Ffive years" because it represents
OL,10,F"working-class culture in this city" so
OL,11,Fhe was "really pleased" it was still
OL,12,Favailable.
